1
00:00:40,979 --> 00:00:41,799
Man, this hard board...

2
00:00:41,859 --> 00:00:43,259
Haven't slept on one in ages, it's killing me.

3
00:00:43,420 --> 00:00:44,219
My back aches so bad.

4
00:00:46,200 --> 00:00:46,719
Er Dongzi.

5
00:00:47,460 --> 00:00:48,079
Still sleeping?

6
00:00:51,700 --> 00:00:52,719
Morning, Brother Haoran.

7
00:00:55,100 --> 00:00:55,619
Er Dongzi.

8
00:00:56,219 --> 00:00:57,840
They say you're the city's top master pickpocket.

9
00:00:58,460 --> 00:00:59,899
Turns out your skills aren't that great.

10
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:04,140
Brother Haoran.

11
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:05,980
I, Er Dongzi, have rules on the job.

12
00:01:06,760 --> 00:01:07,840
Never steal from the poor.

13
00:01:08,620 --> 00:01:09,519
Never touch good folk.

14
00:01:10,439 --> 00:01:11,480
Never mess with the sick.

15
00:01:13,260 --> 00:01:14,019
As for your job...

16
00:01:14,980 --> 00:01:16,400
I'm afraid I just can't take it.

17
00:01:17,519 --> 00:01:19,099
You're really full of shit, aren't you?

18
00:01:19,739 --> 00:01:21,540
Who does he think he is, Robin Hood?

19
00:01:22,819 --> 00:01:23,439
Tell you what.

20
00:01:23,939 --> 00:01:24,739
A bet's a bet.

21
00:01:25,400 --> 00:01:26,120
You're with me from now on.

22
00:01:29,459 --> 00:01:30,579
Just stick with me.

23
00:01:48,480 --> 00:01:50,060
From now on, he's my brother.

24
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:51,099
When you see him out on the street,

25
00:01:51,140 --> 00:01:52,540
show him some respect, you hear me?

26
00:01:53,840 --> 00:01:54,340
Bro...

27
00:01:56,200 --> 00:01:56,760
Your button.

28
00:02:07,099 --> 00:02:07,579
Brother,

29
00:02:08,560 --> 00:02:09,300
just kidding around.

30
00:02:10,500 --> 00:02:11,939
Don't take it to heart.

31
00:02:15,639 --> 00:02:16,580
As for the bet,

32
00:02:17,840 --> 00:02:18,580
let's just forget about it.

33
00:02:21,080 --> 00:02:21,800
From now on,

34
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:25,280
we'll go our separate ways.

35
00:02:26,699 --> 00:02:27,800
Neither of us crosses the other.

36
00:02:34,020 --> 00:02:34,860
You're pretty slick, huh?

37
00:02:37,860 --> 00:02:40,020
You're really putting me on the spot.

38
00:02:41,960 --> 00:02:42,800
Your moves are tough,

39
00:02:43,780 --> 00:02:44,780
and your words are even tougher.

40
00:02:45,900 --> 00:02:47,960
Doesn't that make me look bad either way?

41
00:02:51,620 --> 00:02:52,520
You've had your fun.

42
00:02:53,659 --> 00:02:55,139
Now isn't it my turn?

43
00:02:58,939 --> 00:02:59,500
Liu'er,

44
00:03:00,900 --> 00:03:01,560
Block the view,

45
00:03:01,979 --> 00:03:02,599
seal the door,

46
00:03:03,039 --> 00:03:03,759
clear the floor.

47
00:03:16,240 --> 00:03:17,819
If you dare yell,

48
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:19,659
I'll kill you once we're out.

49
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:20,840
Got it?

50
00:03:25,780 --> 00:03:26,259
Bro...

51
00:03:27,759 --> 00:03:28,520
I didn't yell.

52
00:03:28,840 --> 00:03:29,360
Bro...

53
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:31,280
I made you lose face.

54
00:03:31,900 --> 00:03:32,439
I'm sorry.

55
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:33,560
I'm so sorry, really.

56
00:03:33,860 --> 00:03:35,539
I, Zhang Haoran, am a man of my word.

57
00:03:36,060 --> 00:03:37,379
I said you're rolling with me from now on,

58
00:03:37,479 --> 00:03:39,280
so you're sticking with me. Got it?

59
00:03:40,659 --> 00:03:42,000
You're completely shameless.

60
00:03:45,439 --> 00:03:46,099
Who the hell are you talking to?

61
00:03:48,479 --> 00:03:49,719
Talking to you! What of it?

62
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:53,539
Who do you think you are?

63
00:03:56,840 --> 00:03:58,319
Aren't you a man of your word?

64
00:03:58,759 --> 00:03:59,659
This brother snatched your button,

65
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:00,659
so why aren't you calling him daddy?

66
00:04:04,599 --> 00:04:05,500
Who is this punk?

67
00:04:05,860 --> 00:04:06,300
Bro.

68
00:04:06,740 --> 00:04:08,379
This punk's been trying to act tough ever since he got here.

69
00:04:08,419 --> 00:04:09,699
I've been wanting to beat his ass.

70
00:04:09,800 --> 00:04:10,939
Forget it, let it go.

71
00:04:11,039 --> 00:04:11,400
Bro.

72
00:04:11,599 --> 00:04:12,719
This has nothing to do with him.

73
00:04:13,680 --> 00:04:15,180
He's a famous boss in this city,

74
00:04:15,520 --> 00:04:16,220
Zhang Haoran.

75
00:04:16,899 --> 00:04:18,060
Boss, my ass.

76
00:04:18,860 --> 00:04:19,759
Isn't he just a pimp

77
00:04:19,899 --> 00:04:21,079
living off women and making dirty money?

78
00:04:21,220 --> 00:04:21,839
Don't say it!

79
00:04:22,500 --> 00:04:23,120
Shut up!

80
00:04:25,259 --> 00:04:26,660
This has nothing to do with you anymore.

81
00:04:28,319 --> 00:04:28,800
I...

82
00:04:31,620 --> 00:04:32,399
Brother Haoran!

83
00:04:32,519 --> 00:04:33,079
Nobody move!

84
00:04:36,420 --> 00:04:36,879
Bring it on!

85
00:04:37,100 --> 00:04:38,740
Snap my arm if you got the guts!

86
00:04:41,100 --> 00:04:41,720
What's wrong?

87
00:04:42,019 --> 00:04:42,819
Afraid to put some muscle into it?

88
00:04:42,920 --> 00:04:43,899
Got no strength left?

89
00:04:45,959 --> 00:04:47,040
Feels great! Feels so good!

90
00:04:47,139 --> 00:04:48,199
Come on, keep at it!

91
00:04:48,480 --> 00:04:49,439
Put more muscle into it!

92
00:04:52,699 --> 00:04:53,480
What are you two doing?!

93
00:04:54,740 --> 00:04:55,480
Don't start trouble!

94
00:04:58,040 --> 00:04:58,800
We're not causing trouble!

95
00:04:59,279 --> 00:05:00,420
Can't we just fool around a bit?

96
00:05:01,560 --> 00:05:02,480
Liu Haizhu, come out!

97
00:05:11,540 --> 00:05:12,279
Liu Haizhu!

98
00:05:14,939 --> 00:05:16,319
I'll remember you!

99
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:23,459
What happened here in just one day?

100
00:05:23,860 --> 00:05:24,399
Nothing.

101
00:05:24,920 --> 00:05:25,879
We worked everything out.

102
00:05:26,699 --> 00:05:28,100
I'm a pretty forgiving guy.

103
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:30,300
Sorry for the trouble, Brother, Sister.

104
00:05:31,459 --> 00:05:32,339
Who's your sister?!

105
00:05:32,540 --> 00:05:33,339
Call me Officer!

106
00:05:34,220 --> 00:05:34,939
Sister Officer!

107
00:05:38,060 --> 00:05:38,600
Liu Haizhu.

108
00:05:38,639 --> 00:05:39,139
Come sign here.

109
00:05:42,720 --> 00:05:44,120
You got lucky this time.

110
00:05:45,199 --> 00:05:46,019
The mediation went through.

111
00:05:46,480 --> 00:05:47,639
Still, I have to say a few words.

112
00:05:48,160 --> 00:05:49,399
Be a proper factory worker.

113
00:05:49,680 --> 00:05:51,379
Stop hanging out with those drifters!

114
00:05:53,699 --> 00:05:54,160
Sign here.

115
00:05:56,779 --> 00:05:57,899
Hey, Haizhu.

116
00:05:58,319 --> 00:05:59,620
Fighting made us friends.

117
00:06:00,540 --> 00:06:01,759
It was just a misunderstanding at most.

118
00:06:03,199 --> 00:06:04,540
That big brother you took on is really something.

119
00:06:05,019 --> 00:06:05,879
He's a true boss.

120
00:06:08,899 --> 00:06:10,439
What crazy nonsense are you talking?

121
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:15,319
All right.

122
00:06:16,279 --> 00:06:17,319
Once you're done signing, head out.

123
00:06:21,939 --> 00:06:23,060
Pass a message to the boss.

124
00:06:23,360 --> 00:06:24,040
I admit defeat.

125
00:06:24,759 --> 00:06:25,920
I yield! Totally yield!

126
00:06:27,620 --> 00:06:28,660
Are you nuts?

127
00:06:30,180 --> 00:06:30,959
Shut up.

128
00:06:38,480 --> 00:06:39,220
Aren't you leaving yet?

129
00:06:40,959 --> 00:06:42,920
Man, it's like a war zone out there.

130
00:06:43,800 --> 00:06:45,139
I'm a little terrified.

131
00:07:01,300 --> 00:07:01,779
You're out.

132
00:07:06,959 --> 00:07:07,800
What are you doing here?

133
00:07:08,100 --> 00:07:08,899
Are you all right?

134
00:07:09,279 --> 00:07:10,360
I'm... I'm fine.

135
00:07:11,300 --> 00:07:11,639
Wait, no...

136
00:07:11,660 --> 00:07:13,040
How did you two end up together?

137
00:07:13,259 --> 00:07:14,100
What happened to you?

138
00:07:14,220 --> 00:07:15,800
Ran into some tough bastards inside?

139
00:07:17,959 --> 00:07:18,600
That's normal.

140
00:07:18,980 --> 00:07:19,620
A place like that...

141
00:07:19,879 --> 00:07:20,860
First time's rough, but you get used to it.

142
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:21,939
Did you drop my name?

143
00:07:22,420 --> 00:07:23,199
Next time, drop my name. It works.

144
00:07:23,379 --> 00:07:23,959
Chen Daguang.

145
00:07:24,500 --> 00:07:25,680
Even the guards would offer you smokes.

146
00:07:25,779 --> 00:07:27,279
Can't you wish me well for once?

147
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:30,540
Just saying...

148
00:07:31,600 --> 00:07:32,879
I didn't rat you guys out,

149
00:07:33,120 --> 00:07:34,519
didn't I do right by you?

150
00:07:35,319 --> 00:07:35,740
Brother Zhu,

151
00:07:36,220 --> 00:07:36,779
sure, you did,

152
00:07:37,800 --> 00:07:38,899
but Brother Tian did right by you too.

153
00:07:39,240 --> 00:07:40,259
To get you out,

154
00:07:42,600 --> 00:07:43,920
he threw all that cash right in Huang Zhonghua's face.

155
00:07:44,680 --> 00:07:45,100
Wait...

156
00:07:46,439 --> 00:07:47,379
No, what... what do you mean?

157
00:07:47,500 --> 00:07:48,319
You paid them off?

158
00:07:48,920 --> 00:07:49,399
What?

159
00:07:50,180 --> 00:07:50,860
Ain't that solid?

160
00:07:52,759 --> 00:07:53,740
It... wasn't that much money.

161
00:07:53,959 --> 00:07:56,220
Just over a year's wages for a factory worker.

162
00:07:57,279 --> 00:07:57,680
No...

163
00:07:58,579 --> 00:07:59,639
Ziwen, are you an idiot?

164
00:08:00,339 --> 00:08:01,579
I was innocent in the first place!

165
00:08:01,680 --> 00:08:02,639
I shouldn't have been locked up at all!

166
00:08:02,699 --> 00:08:04,300
And you paid to get me out? What were you thinking?

167
00:08:04,379 --> 00:08:05,980
Brother Tian treats you like real family!

168
00:08:05,980 --> 00:08:07,339
Could he just watch you suffer in there?

169
00:08:07,720 --> 00:08:08,100
Compared to you,

170
00:08:08,220 --> 00:08:09,339
money is worthless!

171
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:10,279
We can always make more.

172
00:08:10,500 --> 00:08:11,879
Still, you shouldn't have given it to that bastard!

173
00:08:11,920 --> 00:08:13,019
What a damn waste!

174
00:08:13,399 --> 00:08:14,060
I'm gonna get it back from him!

175
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:15,459
Zhuzi!

176
00:08:15,939 --> 00:08:16,379
Zhuzi!

177
00:08:16,699 --> 00:08:17,180
You wanna end up back inside?

178
00:08:17,220 --> 00:08:17,740
Look...

179
00:08:17,860 --> 00:08:18,939
Just consider it thrown to the dogs.

180
00:08:19,259 --> 00:08:20,779
At least it made a splash. It's fine.

181
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:22,379
No, they...

182
00:08:22,379 --> 00:08:23,000
Brother Zhu...

183
00:08:28,439 --> 00:08:29,339
Wait for him to come out.

184
00:08:36,179 --> 00:08:36,639
Zhou Meng...

185
00:08:37,840 --> 00:08:38,919
Are you mad at me?

186
00:08:39,600 --> 00:08:40,340
No, I'm not.

187
00:08:42,039 --> 00:08:43,220
Good, as long as you're not mad.

188
00:08:43,700 --> 00:08:44,500
Hey, Ziwen...

189
00:08:45,139 --> 00:08:46,460
Let me introduce you properly.

190
00:08:46,980 --> 00:08:47,440
This is Zhou Meng.

191
00:08:47,659 --> 00:08:49,460
A truck driver from our factory's transport team.

192
00:08:49,500 --> 00:08:50,500
And she's... she's really great.

193
00:08:50,779 --> 00:08:51,340
I know.

194
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:52,639
Sister-in-law, right?

195
00:08:57,659 --> 00:08:58,679
N-No, wait...

196
00:08:59,240 --> 00:09:00,019
I mean...

197
00:09:01,620 --> 00:09:02,179
Liu Haizhu,

198
00:09:02,779 --> 00:09:03,539
then what am I to you?

199
00:09:07,919 --> 00:09:08,559
Is that so?

200
00:09:13,500 --> 00:09:15,460
See? The girl's more upfront than you.

201
00:09:17,960 --> 00:09:18,500
Zhou Meng,

202
00:09:19,399 --> 00:09:20,580
Zhuzi suffered in there,

203
00:09:20,740 --> 00:09:22,100
and you've had it really rough too.

204
00:09:22,419 --> 00:09:23,399
This whole thing started because of me.

205
00:09:23,860 --> 00:09:24,980
Could you give me the chance

206
00:09:25,220 --> 00:09:26,159
to invite you over for a casual meal?

207
00:09:26,320 --> 00:09:26,899
First,

208
00:09:27,100 --> 00:09:27,980
to welcome Zhuzi back,

209
00:09:28,559 --> 00:09:28,899
and second,

210
00:09:29,019 --> 00:09:30,039
so we can properly get to know each other.

211
00:09:30,879 --> 00:09:31,940
Sure, let's go.

212
00:09:32,259 --> 00:09:33,059
What are we eating?

213
00:09:33,279 --> 00:09:34,120
Crispy meatballs again?

214
00:09:34,500 --> 00:09:35,840
Whatever Zhou Meng wants.

215
00:09:36,460 --> 00:09:36,980
Right, right, right.

216
00:09:37,019 --> 00:09:37,759
O-Of course.

217
00:09:38,019 --> 00:09:38,539
Well then...

218
00:09:39,200 --> 00:09:39,740
Let's go.

219
00:09:43,159 --> 00:09:43,779
Alright.

220
00:10:02,600 --> 00:10:03,399
Chen Daguang!

221
00:10:03,899 --> 00:10:05,039
Get down here and peel garlic!

222
00:10:05,700 --> 00:10:06,200
Coming!

223
00:10:09,620 --> 00:10:10,039
Zhuzi.

224
00:10:12,659 --> 00:10:13,860
Time to get some new threads.

225
00:10:14,220 --> 00:10:15,279
You're a man of the world now.

226
00:10:15,360 --> 00:10:16,019
Stop looking like such a hick.

227
00:10:16,399 --> 00:10:17,460
This... is for me?

228
00:10:19,820 --> 00:10:20,419
Try it on.

229
00:10:20,799 --> 00:10:21,220
Alright.

230
00:10:33,919 --> 00:10:35,000
Fits pretty well.

231
00:10:35,340 --> 00:10:36,259
How do I look? Sharp?

232
00:10:36,539 --> 00:10:37,000
Looking sharp.

233
00:10:39,399 --> 00:10:39,879
And these.

234
00:10:41,960 --> 00:10:42,919
I've always wanted to ask...

235
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:44,360
Can you even see the road through these dark lenses?

236
00:10:44,519 --> 00:10:45,379
Try them on and see.

237
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:47,600
Let me see.

238
00:10:50,860 --> 00:10:51,500
You know what...

239
00:10:51,539 --> 00:10:53,019
You can actually see pretty clear.

240
00:10:53,860 --> 00:10:54,600
They're all yours.

241
00:10:55,220 --> 00:10:56,440
I won't be shy, then.

242
00:10:56,460 --> 00:10:56,919
Thanks.

243
00:11:06,059 --> 00:11:06,620
Tell you what,

244
00:11:07,419 --> 00:11:08,399
you actually look pretty cool.

245
00:11:12,740 --> 00:11:13,440
Look at me, what do you think?

246
00:11:13,720 --> 00:11:14,279
Badass, right?

247
00:11:22,139 --> 00:11:24,059
Why do I feel like you're still off?

248
00:11:24,799 --> 00:11:26,019
You're not mad, are you?

249
00:11:26,240 --> 00:11:26,759
No.

250
00:11:27,100 --> 00:11:28,240
I told you, I'm not mad.

251
00:11:31,039 --> 00:11:32,240
Good, as long as you're not mad.

252
00:11:32,639 --> 00:11:33,299
You must be hungry.

253
00:11:33,419 --> 00:11:34,840
I'll go check if the food's ready.

254
00:11:35,639 --> 00:11:36,159
Liu Haizhu!

255
00:11:36,580 --> 00:11:37,220
Get back here!

256
00:11:38,899 --> 00:11:39,399
What is it?

257
00:11:41,500 --> 00:11:42,759
You're really impossible.

258
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:43,519
Everything I tell you

259
00:11:43,620 --> 00:11:44,759
goes in one ear and out the other.

260
00:11:44,840 --> 00:11:45,919
You didn't take a word to heart, did you?

261
00:11:46,580 --> 00:11:47,399
Like what?

262
00:11:47,779 --> 00:11:48,940
I took it all to heart.

263
00:11:49,220 --> 00:11:50,820
I told you no more fighting!

264
00:11:51,080 --> 00:11:53,100
Come on, I really didn't fight this time.

265
00:11:53,179 --> 00:11:53,940
You run with them every day.

266
00:11:54,019 --> 00:11:54,899
You'll end up fighting sooner or later.

267
00:11:56,080 --> 00:11:56,740
No way.

268
00:12:00,720 --> 00:12:03,600
Eastern Tyrant and his guys have principles.

269
00:12:06,240 --> 00:12:07,080
B-But Liu Haizhu,

270
00:12:07,100 --> 00:12:07,860
let me tell you.

271
00:12:08,399 --> 00:12:08,779
You...

272
00:12:09,159 --> 00:12:10,600
Don't think just 'cause you wear a leather jacket

273
00:12:10,779 --> 00:12:11,500
and put on Aviators,

274
00:12:11,539 --> 00:12:13,159
you're some big-time gangster!

275
00:12:13,659 --> 00:12:15,139
What, you wanna be a bad guy?

276
00:12:15,419 --> 00:12:16,700
Come on, what are you talking about?

277
00:12:16,840 --> 00:12:18,139
How could I be a bad guy?

278
00:12:18,980 --> 00:12:19,879
Besides,

279
00:12:20,159 --> 00:12:22,240
gangsters aren't all bad.

280
00:12:22,360 --> 00:12:23,100
Take Ziwen, for instance.

281
00:12:23,539 --> 00:12:23,840
Right?

282
00:12:23,860 --> 00:12:25,080
Those price-gouging thugs...

283
00:12:25,940 --> 00:12:27,100
He beat them up and ran them off.

284
00:12:27,220 --> 00:12:29,000
He took care of those punks at the factory gate, too.

285
00:12:29,440 --> 00:12:30,639
Does that make him a bad guy?

286
00:12:31,620 --> 00:12:32,320
And Ma Limin,

287
00:12:32,500 --> 00:12:33,279
living off public funds,

288
00:12:33,419 --> 00:12:34,940
squeezing the workers and taking handouts...

289
00:12:35,159 --> 00:12:36,240
Is he a good guy?

290
00:12:36,720 --> 00:12:37,679
Right? You can't just—

291
00:12:37,720 --> 00:12:38,639
Keep it down!

292
00:12:40,639 --> 00:12:41,620
How come I never realized

293
00:12:41,720 --> 00:12:42,799
you were so sharp-tongued?

294
00:12:43,340 --> 00:12:44,240
If I'd known, I wouldn't have bothered with you.

295
00:12:54,860 --> 00:12:57,399
Were you pretty worried about me?

296
00:12:58,259 --> 00:12:59,000
What do you think?

297
00:13:05,279 --> 00:13:05,679
Um...

298
00:13:07,779 --> 00:13:08,259
Well...

299
00:13:09,080 --> 00:13:11,080
Back there outside the police station...

300
00:13:11,659 --> 00:13:12,240
you said...

301
00:13:13,740 --> 00:13:15,100
Wh-who... Who are you?

302
00:13:16,039 --> 00:13:17,000
Who am I?

303
00:13:18,240 --> 00:13:20,259
What are we to each other, anyway?

304
00:13:22,399 --> 00:13:23,200
What do you think?

305
00:13:33,820 --> 00:13:35,139
What's gotten into you?

306
00:13:37,080 --> 00:13:38,940
I never would've guessed, Liu Haizhu.

307
00:13:39,559 --> 00:13:40,460
Usually,

308
00:13:41,279 --> 00:13:43,580
you throw punches like a whirlwind,

309
00:13:43,679 --> 00:13:44,779
gutsy as hell.

310
00:13:45,519 --> 00:13:46,820
So how come when it comes to this,

311
00:13:46,940 --> 00:13:48,539
you're like a bashful bride,

312
00:13:48,759 --> 00:13:50,100
blushing all over?

313
00:13:51,480 --> 00:13:51,740
Are you...

314
00:13:51,740 --> 00:13:52,220
No...

315
00:13:52,820 --> 00:13:53,759
embarrassed?

316
00:13:56,059 --> 00:13:56,940
W-Well...

317
00:13:56,980 --> 00:13:57,720
You're shy!

318
00:13:58,279 --> 00:13:59,059
W-Well, um...

319
00:13:59,399 --> 00:14:01,340
does this mean we're...

320
00:14:03,179 --> 00:14:03,679
What?

321
00:14:05,720 --> 00:14:06,159
What?

322
00:14:08,960 --> 00:14:09,519
J-Just...

323
00:14:09,580 --> 00:14:11,639
Welcome drinks are here!

324
00:14:15,360 --> 00:14:16,159
What are you two up to?

325
00:14:18,139 --> 00:14:19,320
N-Nothing, it's nothing.

326
00:14:36,120 --> 00:14:37,679
Where'd that Moutai go?

327
00:14:37,960 --> 00:14:39,019
Now this is real Moutai.

328
00:14:41,639 --> 00:14:42,960
Nothing beats Moutai.

329
00:14:45,139 --> 00:14:45,960
Brother He.

330
00:14:55,600 --> 00:14:57,580
Bro, how'd you find this place?

331
00:15:00,360 --> 00:15:01,120
The slammer.

332
00:15:02,960 --> 00:15:04,059
You're not being straight with me.

333
00:15:05,740 --> 00:15:08,080
Look at you in such a nice place,

334
00:15:10,379 --> 00:15:11,320
eating like a king,

335
00:15:11,820 --> 00:15:12,659
drinking the finest,

336
00:15:13,700 --> 00:15:15,360
while leaving me stuck in that hellhole.

337
00:15:16,279 --> 00:15:16,700
Bro...

338
00:15:17,779 --> 00:15:18,799
This isn't my place.

339
00:15:19,039 --> 00:15:20,159
This is my big bro's place.

340
00:15:23,940 --> 00:15:25,019
Just how many big bros do you have?

341
00:15:32,039 --> 00:15:32,919
There's a broad here.

342
00:15:46,820 --> 00:15:47,480
Who are you?

343
00:15:56,620 --> 00:15:57,379
Stay back!

344
00:16:04,679 --> 00:16:05,080
Bro!

345
00:16:05,100 --> 00:16:05,879
Bro, you can't! Bro!

346
00:16:06,000 --> 00:16:07,259
She's Brother Haoran's friend!

347
00:16:07,460 --> 00:16:07,899
Fuck off!

348
00:16:08,559 --> 00:16:09,620
Just beat me to death!
